  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/0",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "addresses",
        "label": "The good V\u00e1lm\u00edki, first and best / Of hermit saints, these words addressed:",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/1",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "describes",
        "label": "In whom alone these virtues dwell.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A",
        "source_line": 41,
        "source_char_offset": 1299
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/2",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "designates_heir",
        "label": "With him, his best and eldest son / By all his princely virtues won / King Da\u015baratha willed to share / His kingdom as the Regent Heir.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/3",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "demands_gifts",
        "label": "She bade the hapless king bestow / Two gifts he promised long ago, / That R\u00e1ma to the woods should flee, / And that her child the heir should be.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/4",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "obeys_duty",
        "label": "By chains of duty firmly tied, / The wretched king perforce complied.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/5",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "arrives_at",
        "label": "He bade his driver turn and go. / Guha, Nish\u00e1das\u2019 king, he met, / And on the farther bank was set.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/6",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "supports_brother",
        "label": "Then Lakshma\u1e47\u2019s truth was nobly shown, / Then were his love and courage known, / When for his brother\u2019s sake he dared / All perils, and his exile shared.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/7",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "marries",
        "label": "And S\u00edt\u00e1, R\u00e1ma\u2019s darling wife, / Loved even as he loved his life, / Whom happy marks combined to bless, / A miracle of loveliness.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/8",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "leaves",
        "label": "The King and people, sad of mood, / The hero\u2019s car awhile pursued. / But when Prince R\u00e1ma lighted down / At \u015aringavera\u2019s pleasant town, / Where Gang\u00e1\u2019s holy waters flow, / He bade his driver turn and go.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/9",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "pleads_with_brother",
        "label": "Forth to the woods he fared to meet / His brother, fell before his feet, / And cried, \u201cThy claim all men allow: / O come, our lord and king be thou.\u201d",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/10",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "gives_pledge",
        "label": "He placed his sandals in his hand / A pledge that he would rule the land: / And bade his brother turn again.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/11",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "rules",
        "label": "Then Bharat, finding prayer was vain, / The sandals took and went away; / Nor in Ayodhy\u00e1 would he stay. / But turned to Nandigr\u00e1ma, where / He ruled the realm with watchful care.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/12",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "defeats",
        "label": "Vir\u00e1dha, giant fiend, he slew,",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A",
        "source_line": 178,
        "source_char_offset": 5924
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/13",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "befriends",
        "label": "And then Agastya\u2019s friendship knew.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A",
        "source_line": 179,
        "source_char_offset": 5955
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/14",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "injures",
        "label": "R\u00e1ma\u2019s falchion left its trace / Deep cut on \u015a\u00farpa\u1e47akh\u00e1\u2019s face:",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/15",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "attacks",
        "label": "The monster of the triple head. / And D\u00fasha\u1e47 to the contest sped.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/16",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "commands",
        "label": "He bade the fiend M\u00e1r\u00edcha aid / The vengeful plot his fury laid.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/17",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "deceives",
        "label": "There, by M\u00e1r\u00edcha\u2019s magic art, / He wiled the princely youths apart,",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/18",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "dies_protecting_sita",
        "label": "The son of Raghu came and found / Ja\u1e6d\u00e1yu slain upon the ground.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/19",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "defeats",
        "label": "The monstrous fiend he smote and slew, / And in the flame the body threw;",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/20",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "transforms",
        "label": "When straight from out the funeral flame / In lovely form Kabandha came,",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/21",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "advises",
        "label": "And bade him seek in his distress / A wise and holy hermitess.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/22",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "travels_to",
        "label": "By counsel of this saintly dame / To Pamp\u00e1\u2019s pleasant flood he came,",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/23",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "befriends",
        "label": "And there the steadfast friendship won / Of Hanum\u00e1n the Wind-God\u2019s son.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/24",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "confides_in",
        "label": "Counselled by him he told his grief / To great Sugr\u00edva, V\u00e1nar chief,",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/25",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "promises_alliance",
        "label": "And R\u00e1ma lent a willing ear / And promised to allay his fear.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/26",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "attacks",
        "label": "First comforted his trembling wife, / Then sought Sugr\u00edva in the strife.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/27",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "defeats",
        "label": "One shaft from R\u00e1ma\u2019s deadly bow / The monarch in the dust laid low.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/28",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "grants_kingdom",
        "label": "Then R\u00e1ma bade Sugr\u00edva reign / In place of royal B\u00e1li slain.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/29",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "travels_to",
        "label": "Then by Samp\u00e1ti\u2019s counsel led, / Brave Hanum\u00e1n, who mocked at dread, / Sprang at one wild tremendous leap / Two hundred leagues across the deep.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/30",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "finds",
        "label": "There pensive \u2019neath A\u015boka boughs / He found poor S\u00edt\u00e1, R\u00e1ma\u2019s spouse.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/31",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "defeats",
        "label": "Five captains of the host he slew, / Seven sons of councillors o\u2019erthrew;",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/32",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "destroys",
        "label": "The town he burnt with hostile flame,",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A",
        "source_line": 296,
        "source_char_offset": 9919
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/33",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "summons",
        "label": "He smote the sea with shafts as bright / As sunbeams in their summer height, / And quick appeared the Rivers\u2019 King / Obedient to the summoning.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/34",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "builds_bridge",
        "label": "A bridge was thrown by Nala o\u2019er / The narrow sea from shore to shore.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/35",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "defeats",
        "label": "They crossed to Lank\u00e1\u2019s golden town, / Where R\u00e1ma\u2019s hand smote R\u00e1va\u1e47 down.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/36",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "grants_kingdom",
        "label": "Vibhisha\u1e47 there was left to reign / Over his brother\u2019s wide domain.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/37",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "returns_to_husband",
        "label": "To meet her husband S\u00edt\u00e1 came;",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A",
        "source_line": 313,
        "source_char_offset": 10472
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/38",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "questions_wife",
        "label": "With bitter words his wife addressed / Before the crowd that round her pressed.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/39",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "tests_purity",
        "label": "Then S\u00edt\u00e1, touched with noble ire, / Gave her fair body to the fire.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/40",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "clears_honour",
        "label": "And straight the God of Fire appeared, / And words from heaven her honour cleared.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/41",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "reunites_with_wife",
        "label": "Then R\u00e1ma clasped his wife again, / Uninjured, pure from spot and stain.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/42",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "returns_to_capital",
        "label": "Led by the Lord who rules the sky, / The Gods and heavenly saints drew nigh, / And honoured him with worthy meed, / Rejoicing in each glorious deed. / His task achieved, his foe removed, / He triumphed, by the Gods approved.",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "edge:instagraph/43",
      "directed": true,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "raises_from_dead",
        "label": "By grace of Heaven he raised to life / The chieftains slain in mortal strife;",
        "instagraph:color": "#26A"
      }
    }
  ],
